!! XRT-09 XR02(VPNv4 のルート リフレクタ・XRd 26.1.1)。転送の道には入らない(RT03 の先の行き止まり・LDP なし)。
!! 前任者の設定(CHG-1201)。仕込み= M9-2: route-reflector-client が ipv4 unicast の AF の下だけ(PE は ipv4 を張らない= 効かない)。
!!   経路が残らないので前任者が retain route-target all を足した= XR02 は全部持っているのに、RR クライアントが無いので誰にも反映しない。
interface Loopback0
 ipv4 address 10.255.0.21 255.255.255.255
!
interface {{ links[3] }}
 description RR-LINK to RT03
 ipv4 address 10.0.33.21 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 is-type level-2-only
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0021.00
 log adjacency changes
 address-family ipv4 unicast
  metric-style wide
 !
 interface Loopback0
  passive
  address-family ipv4 unicast
  !
 !
 interface {{ links[3] }}
  point-to-point
  address-family ipv4 unicast
   metric 10
  !
 !
!
router bgp 65000
 bgp router-id 10.255.0.21
 address-family ipv4 unicast
 !
 address-family vpnv4 unicast
  retain route-target all
 !
 neighbor 10.255.0.1
  remote-as 65000
  description PE XR01 (CHG-1201)
  update-source Loopback0
  address-family ipv4 unicast
   route-reflector-client
  !
  address-family vpnv4 unicast
  !
 !
 neighbor 10.255.0.12
  remote-as 65000
  description PE RT02 (CHG-1201)
  update-source Loopback0
  address-family ipv4 unicast
   route-reflector-client
  !
  address-family vpnv4 unicast
  !
 !
!
end
